# TruScoreGradingSystem --- Project Brain (v1)

## 1. SYSTEM PURPOSE

Automated sports card pre-grading and decision analysis.

Outputs: - Estimated grade (with confidence distribution) - Market
analysis by grade - Recommendation: submit or not

## 2. CORE PIPELINE

image → identify_card → grade_card → analyze_market → make_decision

## 3. MODULES

Ingestion: image preprocessing only\
Identification: CardSight API\
Grading: defects, corners, edges, centering → grade distribution\
Market: pricing + population\
Decision: expected value + recommendation\
App: UI only

## 4. RULES

-   No duplicate functions\
-   No placeholders\
-   Strict module boundaries\
-   Always follow pipeline

## 5. AI USAGE RULES

-   Modify only relevant files\
-   Reuse existing logic\
-   Do not duplicate\
-   Follow architecture strictly

## 6. PRIORITY

Refactor before adding features.

